    "claims": [
      "Built for automotive suppliers serving OEMs such as Volkswagen, BMW and Daimler",
      "No separate EDI converter or EDI service provider needed",
      "Handles shipment orders, cumulative quantities, release periods and load carrier accounts",
      "Calculates running shipment weights, volumes and storage locations for packaging rules",
      "Generates VDA, GTL, ODETTE and AIAG goods labels with SSCC",
      "Produces forwarding orders, goods slips and CMR documents",
      "Supports VDA, Global, Odette and ANSI X12 standards, configurable without code",
      "EDI mappings like VDA4905 or VDA4984 can be loaded from the Yaveon shop",
      "Tracks transmission via OFTP2 or AS2 through to the recipient",
      "Covers unloading points, DUNS numbers, routing codes and sequence numbers",
      "Supports supplier logistics centers, contract manufacturers and sequencers",
      "Message types configurable per partner type including customers, suppliers and logistics partners",
      "Supports DELFOR, DELINS, DELJIT, DESADV, INVOICE, CREADV, REMADV and INVRPT messages",
      "Special procedures like Daimler PUS and Perlenkette can be set up",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
    ],
